  unitName: Cyber Viviane (EU)
  unitId: 720164
  unitNumber: 7112
  description: There are legends of a majestic island, hidden in plain sight, so
    mystical that anyone residing there would be filled with incredible magical energy.
    Its inhabitants call it NeoAvalon. The power it holds should never fall into
    the hands of an ill willed individual and that is why the people of NeoAvalon
    use their vastly advanced technological prowess to conceal the entire island
    from the common eye. Only those from the royal bloodline can see that the island
    exists. Sometimes, to help them make a difference in their world, Avalon's guardians
    have gifted good willed people some of their technology. Viviane is one of these
    cybernetic guardians. After being saved by Arthur from drowning, she chose to
    take him to the island. It is there that she taught him the ways of her people
    and their mastery of advanced engineering. She went as far as to tell him how
    the island cloaks itself, and as they bonded, she felt that this young man had
    the purest of souls.
  summonDesc: I will protect Avalon and its secrets until the end of time!
  fusionDesc: Thank you for helping me enhance my cybernetics.
